2. SOC 2 合规工程2.1 SOC 2 信任原则┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐│ SOC 2 信任原则 │├─────────────────────────────────────────┤│ Security（安全） ← 必须 ││ ├── 访问控制 ││ ├── 入侵检测 ││ └── 安全事件响应 │├─────────────────────────────────────────┤│ Availability（可用性） ← 可选 ││ ├── SLA 监控 ││ ├── 灾难恢复 ││ └── 容量规划 │├─────────────────────────────────────────┤│ Confidentiality（机密性） ← 可选 ││ ├── 数据加密 ││ ├── 数据分类 ││ └── 保密协议 │├─────────────────────────────────────────┤│ Processing Integrity ← 可选 ││ ├── 数据完整性校验 ││ ├── 处理日志 ││ └── 错误处理 │├─────────────────────────────────────────┤│ Privacy（隐私） ← 可选 ││ ├── 隐私通知 ││ ├── 数据最小化 ││ └── 个人数据权利 │└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
2.2 合规即代码（OPA + Rego）# policies/soc2/access-control.rego - SOC 2 访问控制策略package soc2.access_controlimport rego.v1# CC6.1: 逻辑访问控制deny contains msg if &#123; some user in input.users not user.mfa_enabled msg := sprintf(&quot;User %s does not have MFA enabled (CC6.1)&quot;, [user.id])&#125;# CC6.2: 最小权限原则deny contains msg if &#123; some role in input.roles count(role.permissions) &gt; 50 msg := sprintf(&quot;Role %s has %d permissions, exceeds maximum of 50 (CC6.2)&quot;, [role.name, count(role.permissions)])&#125;# CC6.3: 定期访问审查deny contains msg if &#123; some review in input.access_reviews review.last_review_date &lt; time.add_date(time.now_ns(), -90, 0, 0) msg := sprintf(&quot;Access review for %s is overdue (last: %s) (CC6.3)&quot;, [review.scope, review.last_review_date])&#125;# CC6.6: 外部威胁防护deny contains msg if &#123; not input.network.firewall_enabled msg := &quot;Firewall is not enabled (CC6.6)&quot;&#125;deny contains msg if &#123; some endpoint in input.endpoints not endpoint.encryption_in_transit msg := sprintf(&quot;Endpoint %s does not enforce encryption in transit (CC6.6)&quot;, [endpoint.name])&#125;# CC7.1: 安全事件检测deny contains msg if &#123; not input.monitoring.siem_enabled msg := &quot;SIEM is not enabled (CC7.1)&quot;&#125;deny contains msg if &#123; input.monitoring.alert_latency_hours &gt; 1 msg := sprintf(&quot;Security alert latency is %d hours, exceeds 1 hour SLA (CC7.1)&quot;, [input.monitoring.alert_latency_hours])&#125;# CC8.1: 变更管理deny contains msg if &#123; some change in input.changes not change.approved msg := sprintf(&quot;Change %s was deployed without approval (CC8.1)&quot;, [change.id])&#125;deny contains msg if &#123; some change in input.changes not change.tested msg := sprintf(&quot;Change %s was deployed without testing (CC8.1)&quot;, [change.id])&#125;
# policies/soc2/encryption.rego - SOC 2 加密策略package soc2.encryptionimport rego.v1# CC6.7: 传输加密deny contains msg if &#123; some service in input.services not service.tls_enabled msg := sprintf(&quot;Service %s does not have TLS enabled (CC6.7)&quot;, [service.name])&#125;deny contains msg if &#123; some service in input.services service.tls_min_version != &quot;1.3&quot; msg := sprintf(&quot;Service %s allows TLS &lt; 1.3 (CC6.7)&quot;, [service.name])&#125;# CC6.7: 静态加密deny contains msg if &#123; some db in input.databases not db.encryption_at_rest msg := sprintf(&quot;Database %s does not have encryption at rest (CC6.7)&quot;, [db.name])&#125;# 密钥管理deny contains msg if &#123; some key in input.encryption_keys key.rotation_days &gt; 365 msg := sprintf(&quot;Key %s has not been rotated in %d days (CC6.7)&quot;, [key.id, key.rotation_days])&#125;deny contains msg if &#123; some key in input.encryption_keys key.algorithm == &quot;AES-128&quot; msg := sprintf(&quot;Key %s uses weak algorithm AES-128, require AES-256 (CC6.7)&quot;, [key.id])&#125;
2.3 自动化合规检测 CI&#x2F;CD# .github/workflows/compliance.yml - 合规检测流水线name: Compliance Checkon: push: branches: [main] pull_request: branches: [main] schedule: - cron: &#x27;0 6 * * 1&#x27; # 每周一 6:00jobs: policy-check: runs-on: ubuntu-latest steps: - uses: actions/checkout@v4 # OPA 策略检查 - name: Run OPA Policy Check uses: open-policy-agent/conftest-action@v1 with: files: infrastructure/ policy: policies/ fail-on-warn: true terraform-compliance: runs-on: ubuntu-latest steps: - uses: actions/checkout@v4 # Terraform 合规扫描 - name: Setup TFLint uses: terraform-linters/setup-tflint@v4 - name: Run TFLint run: tflint --recursive # Checkov 安全扫描 - name: Run Checkov uses: bridgecrewio/checkov-action@v12 with: directory: infrastructure/ framework: terraform soft_fail: false output_format: sarif # tfsec 安全扫描 - name: Run tfsec uses: aquasecurity/tfsec-action@v1 with: working_directory: infrastructure/ dependency-scan: runs-on: ubuntu-latest steps: - uses: actions/checkout@v4 # 依赖漏洞扫描 - name: Run Trivy uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master with: scan-type: &#x27;fs&#x27; scan-ref: &#x27;.&#x27; severity: &#x27;HIGH,CRITICAL&#x27; exit-code: &#x27;1&#x27; # License 合规检查 - name: Check License Compliance run: | npx license-checker --failOn &#x27;GPL-3.0;AGPL-3.0&#x27; --summary secret-scan: runs-on: ubuntu-latest steps: - uses: actions/checkout@v4 with: fetch-depth: 0 # 密钥泄露扫描 - name: Run Gitleaks uses: gitleaks/gitleaks-action@v2 env: GITHUB_TOKEN: $&#123;&#123; secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN &#125;&#125; compliance-report: needs: [policy-check, terraform-compliance, dependency-scan, secret-scan] runs-on: ubuntu-latest if: always() steps: - name: Generate Compliance Report uses: actions/github-script@v7 with: script: | const results = &#123; policyCheck: &#x27;$&#123;&#123; needs.policy-check.result &#125;&#125;&#x27;, terraformCompliance: &#x27;$&#123;&#123; needs.terraform-compliance.result &#125;&#125;&#x27;, dependencyScan: &#x27;$&#123;&#123; needs.dependency-scan.result &#125;&#125;&#x27;, secretScan: &#x27;$&#123;&#123; needs.secret-scan.result &#125;&#125;&#x27;, timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), &#125;; const allPassed = Object.values(results).every(r =&gt; r === &#x27;success&#x27;); await github.rest.repos.createCommitStatus(&#123; owner: context.repo.owner, repo: context.repo.repo, sha: context.sha, state: allPassed ? &#x27;success&#x27; : &#x27;failure&#x27;, context: &#x27;compliance-check&#x27;, description: allPassed ? &#x27;All compliance checks passed&#x27; : &#x27;Some compliance checks failed&#x27;, &#125;);
3. GDPR 隐私工程3.1 数据分类与标记// lib/data-classification.ts - 数据分类系统enum DataClassification &#123; PUBLIC = &#x27;public&#x27;, INTERNAL = &#x27;internal&#x27;, CONFIDENTIAL = &#x27;confidential&#x27;, RESTRICTED = &#x27;restricted&#x27;, PERSONAL_DATA = &#x27;personal_data&#x27;, SENSITIVE_PERSONAL = &#x27;sensitive_personal&#x27;,&#125;interface DataElement &#123; name: string; classification: DataClassification; retentionPeriod: number; // 天 legalBasis?: string; // GDPR 合法基础 purpose?: string; // 处理目的 crossBorderTransfer: boolean; encryptionRequired: boolean;&#125;const dataRegistry: Record&lt;string, DataElement&gt; = &#123; &#x27;user.email&#x27;: &#123; name: &#x27;User Email&#x27;, classification: DataClassification.PERSONAL_DATA, retentionPeriod: 365, legalBasis: &#x27;contract&#x27;, purpose: &#x27;Account communication&#x27;, crossBorderTransfer: false, encryptionRequired: true, &#125;, &#x27;user.name&#x27;: &#123; name: &#x27;User Full Name&#x27;, classification: DataClassification.PERSONAL_DATA, retentionPeriod: 365, legalBasis: &#x27;contract&#x27;, purpose: &#x27;User identification&#x27;, crossBorderTransfer: false, encryptionRequired: false, &#125;, &#x27;user.health_data&#x27;: &#123; name: &#x27;Health Information&#x27;, classification: DataClassification.SENSITIVE_PERSONAL, retentionPeriod: 180, legalBasis: &#x27;explicit_consent&#x27;, purpose: &#x27;Health service delivery&#x27;, crossBorderTransfer: false, encryptionRequired: true, &#125;, &#x27;payment.card_number&#x27;: &#123; name: &#x27;Payment Card Number&#x27;, classification: DataClassification.RESTRICTED, retentionPeriod: 90, legalBasis: &#x27;legitimate_interest&#x27;, purpose: &#x27;Payment processing&#x27;, crossBorderTransfer: true, encryptionRequired: true, &#125;,&#125;;// 数据流分析class DataFlowAnalyzer &#123; // 扫描代码中的数据处理 async analyzeCodebase(sourceDir: string): Promise&lt;DataFlowReport&gt; &#123; const findings: DataFlowFinding[] = []; // 扫描数据库查询 const sqlFiles = await glob(`$&#123;sourceDir&#125;/**/*.sql`); for (const file of sqlFiles) &#123; const content = await fs.readFile(file, &#x27;utf-8&#x27;); const tables = this.extractTables(content); for (const table of tables) &#123; const elements = this.matchDataElements(table); for (const element of elements) &#123; findings.push(&#123; file, type: &#x27;database_query&#x27;, dataElement: element, classification: element.classification, line: this.findLineNumber(content, table), &#125;); &#125; &#125; &#125; // 扫描 API 端点 const apiFiles = await glob(`$&#123;sourceDir&#125;/**/routes/**/*.ts`); for (const file of apiFiles) &#123; const content = await fs.readFile(file, &#x27;utf-8&#x27;); const responses = this.extractResponseFields(content); for (const field of responses) &#123; const element = dataRegistry[field]; if (element) &#123; findings.push(&#123; file, type: &#x27;api_response&#x27;, dataElement: element, classification: element.classification, line: this.findLineNumber(content, field), &#125;); &#125; &#125; &#125; return &#123; timestamp: new Date(), totalFindings: findings.length, byClassification: this.groupByClassification(findings), findings, &#125;; &#125; // 生成数据处理记录（ROPA） async generateROPA(): Promise&lt;RecordOfProcessingActivities&gt; &#123; const activities: ProcessingActivity[] = []; for (const [key, element] of Object.entries(dataRegistry)) &#123; activities.push(&#123; controller: &#x27;Example Corp&#x27;, purpose: element.purpose || &#x27;Unknown&#x27;, legalBasis: element.legalBasis || &#x27;Unknown&#x27;, dataCategories: [element.name], dataSubjects: [&#x27;Users&#x27;], recipients: element.crossBorderTransfer ? [&#x27;International partners&#x27;] : [&#x27;Internal&#x27;], retentionPeriod: `$&#123;element.retentionPeriod&#125; days`, securityMeasures: &#123; encryption: element.encryptionRequired, accessControl: true, auditLogging: true, &#125;, &#125;); &#125; return &#123; version: &#x27;2026.1&#x27;, activities &#125;; &#125;&#125;
3.2 数据主体权利实现// lib/data-subject-rights.ts - GDPR 数据主体权利class DataSubjectRightsService &#123; // 访问权（Article 15） async handleAccessRequest(userId: string): Promise&lt;DataExport&gt; &#123; const data = &#123; personalData: await this.collectPersonalData(userId), processingPurposes: await this.getProcessingPurposes(userId), dataCategories: await this.getDataCategories(userId), recipients: await this.getDataRecipients(userId), retentionPeriods: await this.getRetentionPeriods(userId), rights: [ &#x27;right_to_rectification&#x27;, &#x27;right_to_erasure&#x27;, &#x27;right_to_restrict_processing&#x27;, &#x27;right_to_data_portability&#x27;, ], source: await this.getDataSource(userId), automatedDecisionMaking: await this.getAutomatedDecisions(userId), &#125;; // 生成机器可读格式（JSON + CSV） const exportPackage = &#123; format: &#x27;json&#x27;, generatedAt: new Date().toISOString(), data, &#125;; // 记录请求 await this.logRequest(userId, &#x27;access&#x27;, exportPackage); return exportPackage; &#125; // 删除权 / 被遗忘权（Article 17） async handleErasureRequest(userId: string, reason: string): Promise&lt;ErasureResult&gt; &#123; // 检查是否有保留义务 const retentionObligations = await this.checkRetentionObligations(userId); if (retentionObligations.length &gt; 0) &#123; return &#123; status: &#x27;partial&#x27;, deleted: [], retained: retentionObligations, reason: &#x27;Legal retention obligations apply&#x27;, &#125;; &#125; // 执行删除 const deleted: string[] = []; // 1. 删除用户账户数据 await db.users.delete(&#123; id: userId &#125;); deleted.push(&#x27;user_account&#x27;); // 2. 删除关联数据 await db.sessions.deleteMany(&#123; userId &#125;); deleted.push(&#x27;sessions&#x27;); await db.auditLogs.updateMany( &#123; userId &#125;, &#123; $set: &#123; userId: &#x27;[DELETED]&#x27;, anonymized: true &#125; &#125; ); deleted.push(&#x27;audit_logs_anonymized&#x27;); // 3. 通知第三方 const thirdParties = await this.getThirdPartyRecipients(userId); for (const party of thirdParties) &#123; await this.sendErasureNotification(party, userId); deleted.push(`notified_$&#123;party&#125;`); &#125; // 4. 从备份标记（下次备份周期清除） await this.markForBackupCleanup(userId); await this.logRequest(userId, &#x27;erasure&#x27;, &#123; deleted, reason &#125;); return &#123; status: &#x27;complete&#x27;, deleted, retained: [] &#125;; &#125; // 数据可携带权（Article 20） async handlePortabilityRequest(userId: string, format: &#x27;json&#x27; | &#x27;csv&#x27;): Promise&lt;DataExport&gt; &#123; const data = await this.collectPortableData(userId); let exportContent: string; let mimeType: string; if (format === &#x27;csv&#x27;) &#123; exportContent = this.toCSV(data); mimeType = &#x27;text/csv&#x27;; &#125; else &#123; exportContent = JSON.stringify(data, null, 2); mimeType = &#x27;application/json&#x27;; &#125; await this.logRequest(userId, &#x27;portability&#x27;, &#123; format, dataSize: exportContent.length &#125;); return &#123; content: exportContent, mimeType, filename: `data-export-$&#123;userId&#125;.$&#123;format&#125;`, &#125;; &#125; // 反对权（Article 21） async handleObjectionRequest( userId: string, processingPurpose: string ): Promise&lt;ObjectionResult&gt; &#123; // 评估合法利益 const legitimateInterest = await this.assessLegitimateInterest( userId, processingPurpose ); if (legitimateInterest.overrides) &#123; return &#123; status: &#x27;denied&#x27;, reason: &#x27;Compelling legitimate grounds for processing&#x27;, &#125;; &#125; // 停止处理 await this.stopProcessing(userId, processingPurpose); await this.logRequest(userId, &#x27;objection&#x27;, &#123; purpose: processingPurpose &#125;); return &#123; status: &#x27;accepted&#x27;, stoppedProcessing: processingPurpose &#125;; &#125; // 同意管理 async updateConsent( userId: string, consents: Array&lt;&#123; purpose: string; granted: boolean &#125;&gt; ): Promise&lt;void&gt; &#123; for (const consent of consents) &#123; await db.consents.upsert( &#123; userId, purpose: consent.purpose &#125;, &#123; granted: consent.granted, grantedAt: consent.granted ? new Date() : null, withdrawnAt: consent.granted ? null : new Date(), version: await this.getCurrentConsentVersion(consent.purpose), &#125; ); if (!consent.granted) &#123; // 停止基于该同意的处理 await this.stopProcessing(userId, consent.purpose); &#125; &#125; &#125;&#125;
3.3 Cookie 合规// lib/cookie-consent.ts - Cookie 同意管理interface CookieCategory &#123; id: string; name: string; description: string; required: boolean; cookies: string[];&#125;const cookieCategories: CookieCategory[] = [ &#123; id: &#x27;essential&#x27;, name: &#x27;Essential Cookies&#x27;, description: &#x27;Required for basic site functionality&#x27;, required: true, cookies: [&#x27;session_id&#x27;, &#x27;csrf_token&#x27;, &#x27;auth_token&#x27;], &#125;, &#123; id: &#x27;analytics&#x27;, name: &#x27;Analytics Cookies&#x27;, description: &#x27;Help us understand how visitors use the site&#x27;, required: false, cookies: [&#x27;_ga&#x27;, &#x27;_gid&#x27;, &#x27;_gat&#x27;], &#125;, &#123; id: &#x27;marketing&#x27;, name: &#x27;Marketing Cookies&#x27;, description: &#x27;Used for targeted advertising&#x27;, required: false, cookies: [&#x27;_fbp&#x27;, &#x27;_gcl_au&#x27;, &#x27;ads_prefs&#x27;], &#125;, &#123; id: &#x27;functional&#x27;, name: &#x27;Functional Cookies&#x27;, description: &#x27;Enable personalized features&#x27;, required: false, cookies: [&#x27;theme_pref&#x27;, &#x27;language&#x27;, &#x27;region&#x27;], &#125;,];// 服务端 Cookie 中间件function cookieConsentMiddleware(request: Request): Response | null &#123; const consentCookie = request.headers.get(&#x27;Cookie&#x27;); const consent = parseConsentCookie(consentCookie); // 检查是否有有效同意 if (!consent || consent.timestamp &lt; getConsentPolicyVersion()) &#123; // 需要重新获取同意 return null; // 继续处理，但注入同意横幅 &#125; // 过滤未授权的 Cookie const allowedCookies = getAllowedCookies(consent); // 设置 Cookie 时检查授权 return null;&#125;// 同意 APIasync function handleConsentUpdate(request: Request): Promise&lt;Response&gt; &#123; const body = await request.json() as &#123; categories: Record&lt;string, boolean&gt;; timestamp: number; &#125;; // 验证必要类别始终为 true body.categories[&#x27;essential&#x27;] = true; // 存储同意记录 await db.consentLogs.insert(&#123; sessionId: getSessionId(request), categories: body.categories, timestamp: new Date(body.timestamp), policyVersion: getConsentPolicyVersion(), userAgent: request.headers.get(&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;), &#125;); // 设置同意 Cookie const consentValue = Object.entries(body.categories) .filter(([, granted]) =&gt; granted) .map(([id]) =&gt; id) .join(&#x27;,&#x27;); const cookie = `cookie_consent=$&#123;consentValue&#125;; ` + `Max-Age=$&#123;365 * 24 * 60 * 60&#125;; ` + `Path=/; SameSite=Lax; Secure`; return Response.json(&#123; success: true &#125;, &#123; headers: &#123; &#x27;Set-Cookie&#x27;: cookie &#125;, &#125;);&#125;
4. 自动化证据收集4.1 持续合规监控// lib/compliance-monitor.ts - 持续合规监控interface ComplianceEvidence &#123; id: string; controlId: string; framework: string; collectedAt: Date; status: &#x27;pass&#x27; | &#x27;fail&#x27; | &#x27;warning&#x27;; evidence: Record&lt;string, any&gt;; automated: boolean; expiresAt: Date;&#125;class ComplianceMonitor &#123; private checks: ComplianceCheck[]; // 收集证据 async collectEvidence(): Promise&lt;ComplianceEvidence[]&gt; &#123; const results: ComplianceEvidence[] = []; for (const check of this.checks) &#123; try &#123; const evidence = await check.execute(); results.push(evidence); // 存储到证据库 await db.evidence.insert(evidence); // 失败时告警 if (evidence.status === &#x27;fail&#x27;) &#123; await this.alertFailure(evidence); &#125; &#125; catch (error) &#123; results.push(&#123; id: crypto.randomUUID(), controlId: check.controlId, framework: check.framework, collectedAt: new Date(), status: &#x27;fail&#x27;, evidence: &#123; error: String(error) &#125;, automated: true, expiresAt: new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000), &#125;); &#125; &#125; return results; &#125;&#125;// 具体检查实现class MFAComplianceCheck implements ComplianceCheck &#123; controlId = &#x27;CC6.1&#x27;; framework = &#x27;SOC 2&#x27;; async execute(): Promise&lt;ComplianceEvidence&gt; &#123; // 检查所有用户是否启用 MFA const users = await db.users.findMany(&#123; active: true &#125;); const usersWithoutMFA = users.filter((u) =&gt; !u.mfaEnabled); const passRate = ((users.length - usersWithoutMFA.length) / users.length) * 100; return &#123; id: crypto.randomUUID(), controlId: this.controlId, framework: this.framework, collectedAt: new Date(), status: passRate === 100 ? &#x27;pass&#x27; : passRate &gt;= 95 ? &#x27;warning&#x27; : &#x27;fail&#x27;, evidence: &#123; totalUsers: users.length, usersWithMFA: users.length - usersWithoutMFA.length, usersWithoutMFA: usersWithoutMFA.map((u) =&gt; u.email), passRate, &#125;, automated: true, expiresAt: new Date(Date.now() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000), &#125;; &#125;&#125;class EncryptionComplianceCheck implements ComplianceCheck &#123; controlId = &#x27;CC6.7&#x27;; framework = &#x27;SOC 2&#x27;; async execute(): Promise&lt;ComplianceEvidence&gt; &#123; // 检查数据库加密 const databases = await this.scanDatabases(); const unencryptedDBs = databases.filter((db) =&gt; !db.encryptedAtRest); // 检查 TLS 配置 const endpoints = await this.scanEndpoints(); const weakTLS = endpoints.filter((ep) =&gt; ep.tlsVersion &lt; 1.3); // 检查密钥轮转 const keys = await this.scanEncryptionKeys(); const expiredKeys = keys.filter((k) =&gt; k.lastRotated &lt; Date.now() - 365 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000); const allPass = unencryptedDBs.length === 0 &amp;&amp; weakTLS.length === 0 &amp;&amp; expiredKeys.length === 0; return &#123; id: crypto.randomUUID(), controlId: this.controlId, framework: this.framework, collectedAt: new Date(), status: allPass ? &#x27;pass&#x27; : &#x27;fail&#x27;, evidence: &#123; databases: &#123; total: databases.length, unencrypted: unencryptedDBs.length &#125;, tls: &#123; total: endpoints.length, weakTLS: weakTLS.length &#125;, keys: &#123; total: keys.length, expired: expiredKeys.length &#125;, &#125;, automated: true, expiresAt: new Date(Date.now() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000), &#125;; &#125;&#125;class AccessReviewCheck implements ComplianceCheck &#123; controlId = &#x27;CC6.3&#x27;; framework = &#x27;SOC 2&#x27;; async execute(): Promise&lt;ComplianceEvidence&gt; &#123; const reviews = await db.accessReviews.findMany(); const overdue = reviews.filter((r) =&gt; &#123; const daysSinceReview = (Date.now() - r.lastReviewDate.getTime()) / (24 * 60 * 60 * 1000); return daysSinceReview &gt; 90; &#125;); return &#123; id: crypto.randomUUID(), controlId: this.controlId, framework: this.framework, collectedAt: new Date(), status: overdue.length === 0 ? &#x27;pass&#x27; : &#x27;fail&#x27;, evidence: &#123; totalReviews: reviews.length, overdueReviews: overdue.map((r) =&gt; (&#123; scope: r.scope, lastReview: r.lastReviewDate, daysOverdue: Math.floor( (Date.now() - r.lastReviewDate.getTime()) / (24 * 60 * 60 * 1000) - 90 ), &#125;)), &#125;, automated: true, expiresAt: new Date(Date.now() + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000), &#125;; &#125;&#125;
5. 隐私工程实践5.1 隐私设计模式// lib/privacy-patterns.ts - 隐私设计模式// 1. 数据最小化 - 仅收集必要数据class DataMinimization &#123; // 注册时仅收集必要字段 static registrationSchema = &#123; required: [&#x27;email&#x27;, &#x27;password&#x27;], optional: [&#x27;name&#x27;], // 不收集：手机号、生日、地址（除非业务必需） &#125;; // API 响应过滤 static filterResponse&lt;T extends Record&lt;string, any&gt;&gt;( data: T, allowedFields: string[] ): Partial&lt;T&gt; &#123; const filtered: Partial&lt;T&gt; = &#123;&#125;; for (const field of allowedFields) &#123; if (field in data) &#123; (filtered as any)[field] = data[field]; &#125; &#125; return filtered; &#125;&#125;// 2. 数据匿名化class DataAnonymization &#123; // 假名化（可逆） static pseudonymize(value: string, key: string): string &#123; const hmac = crypto.createHmac(&#x27;sha256&#x27;, key); hmac.update(value); return hmac.digest(&#x27;hex&#x27;); &#125; // 匿名化（不可逆） static anonymize(value: string): string &#123; const salt = crypto.randomBytes(16); const hash = crypto.pbkdf2Sync(value, salt, 100000, 32, &#x27;sha256&#x27;); return `$&#123;salt.toString(&#x27;hex&#x27;)&#125;:$&#123;hash.toString(&#x27;hex&#x27;)&#125;`; &#125; // 差分隐私 static addNoise(value: number, epsilon: number): number &#123; const sensitivity = 1; const scale = sensitivity / epsilon; const noise = this.laplaceNoise(scale); return value + noise; &#125; private static laplaceNoise(scale: number): number &#123; const u = Math.random() - 0.5; return -scale * Math.sign(u) * Math.log(1 - 2 * Math.abs(u)); &#125;&#125;// 3. 数据保留策略class DataRetention &#123; static policies = &#123; userAccount: &#123; active: -1, deleted: 30 &#125;, // 删除后保留 30 天 session: &#123; maxAge: 14 &#125;, // 会话最多 14 天 auditLog: &#123; maxAge: 2555 &#125;, // 审计日志保留 7 年 analytics: &#123; maxAge: 365 &#125;, // 分析数据保留 1 年 supportTicket: &#123; resolved: 180 &#125;, // 工单解决后保留 180 天 &#125;; // 自动清理 static async runCleanup(): Promise&lt;CleanupResult&gt; &#123; const results: CleanupResult = &#123; deletedRecords: 0, anonymizedRecords: 0, errors: [], &#125;; // 清理过期会话 const expiredSessions = await db.sessions.deleteMany(&#123; lastAccessedAt: &#123; $lt: new Date(Date.now() - 14 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000) &#125;, &#125;); results.deletedRecords += expiredSessions; // 匿名化旧审计日志 const oldLogs = await db.auditLogs.findMany(&#123; createdAt: &#123; $lt: new Date(Date.now() - 2555 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000) &#125;, &#125;); for (const log of oldLogs) &#123; await db.auditLogs.update( &#123; id: log.id &#125;, &#123; userId: &#x27;[ANONYMIZED]&#x27;, ipAddress: &#x27;[ANONYMIZED]&#x27;, details: &#123;&#125;, &#125; ); results.anonymizedRecords++; &#125; return results; &#125;&#125;// 4. 隐私影响评估（DPIA）interface DPIAReport &#123; id: string; project: string; dataTypes: string[]; processingPurpose: string; necessityAssessment: NecessityAssessment; riskAssessment: RiskAssessment; mitigationMeasures: string[]; dpoApproval: boolean; date: Date;&#125;class PrivacyImpactAssessment &#123; async conductDPIA(project: DPIAInput): Promise&lt;DPIAReport&gt; &#123; // 必要性评估 const necessity = this.assessNecessity(project); // 风险评估 const risk = this.assessRisk(project); // 缓解措施 const mitigations = this.recommendMitigations(risk); // DPO 审批 const requiresDPO = risk.level === &#x27;high&#x27; || risk.level === &#x27;critical&#x27;; return &#123; id: crypto.randomUUID(), project: project.name, dataTypes: project.dataTypes, processingPurpose: project.purpose, necessityAssessment: necessity, riskAssessment: risk, mitigationMeasures: mitigations, dpoApproval: !requiresDPO, // 低风险自动通过 date: new Date(), &#125;; &#125; private assessRisk(project: DPIAInput): RiskAssessment &#123; let score = 0; // 数据类型风险 if (project.dataTypes.includes(&#x27;health&#x27;)) score += 30; if (project.dataTypes.includes(&#x27;financial&#x27;)) score += 20; if (project.dataTypes.includes(&#x27;children&#x27;)) score += 30; // 处理规模 if (project.dataSubjects &gt; 100000) score += 20; if (project.dataSubjects &gt; 1000000) score += 30; // 跨境传输 if (project.crossBorderTransfer) score += 15; // 自动化决策 if (project.automatedDecisionMaking) score += 20; const level = score &gt;= 70 ? &#x27;critical&#x27; : score &gt;= 40 ? &#x27;high&#x27; : score &gt;= 20 ? &#x27;medium&#x27; : &#x27;low&#x27;; return &#123; score, level, factors: [] &#125;; &#125;&#125;
6. 合规仪表板6.1 合规状态 API// api/compliance-dashboard.ts - 合规仪表板interface ComplianceDashboard &#123; overallScore: number; frameworks: FrameworkStatus[]; recentFindings: Finding[]; evidenceStatus: EvidenceStatus; trends: ComplianceTrend[];&#125;async function getComplianceDashboard(): Promise&lt;ComplianceDashboard&gt; &#123; // 总体合规分数 const allControls = await db.controls.findMany(); const passingControls = allControls.filter((c) =&gt; c.status === &#x27;pass&#x27;); const overallScore = (passingControls.length / allControls.length) * 100; // 各框架状态 const frameworks: FrameworkStatus[] = []; for (const framework of [&#x27;SOC 2&#x27;, &#x27;GDPR&#x27;, &#x27;ISO 27001&#x27;]) &#123; const controls = allControls.filter((c) =&gt; c.framework === framework); const passing = controls.filter((c) =&gt; c.status === &#x27;pass&#x27;); frameworks.push(&#123; name: framework, score: (passing.length / controls.length) * 100, totalControls: controls.length, passingControls: passing.length, failingControls: controls.filter((c) =&gt; c.status === &#x27;fail&#x27;).length, lastAudit: await getLastAuditDate(framework), nextAudit: await getNextAuditDate(framework), &#125;); &#125; // 最近发现 const recentFindings = await db.findings.findMany(&#123; status: &#123; $in: [&#x27;open&#x27;, &#x27;in_progress&#x27;] &#125;, $orderBy: &#123; severity: &#x27;desc&#x27;, createdAt: &#x27;desc&#x27; &#125;, $limit: 10, &#125;); // 证据状态 const evidence = await db.evidence.findMany(&#123; collectedAt: &#123; $gte: new Date(Date.now() - 30 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000) &#125;, &#125;); return &#123; overallScore, frameworks, recentFindings, evidenceStatus: &#123; total: evidence.length, automated: evidence.filter((e) =&gt; e.automated).length, expiringSoon: evidence.filter((e) =&gt; e.expiresAt &lt; new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000) ).length, &#125;, trends: await getComplianceTrends(90), &#125;;&#125;
7. 典型案例：GDPR 数据导出7.1 问题背景SaaS 平台收到欧盟用户数据请求：30 天内导出其全部个人数据（Article 15&#x2F;20）并删除营销数据（Article 17）。个人数据散落在订单、营销、日志、客服工单等 6 个系统，此前从未演练，手动导出预估 25 人日。 7.2 解决方案按数据分类目录圈定范围 → 异步导出任务编排（各系统适配器并行拉取）→ 交叉 PII 过滤 → 保留义务校验（财务数据 10 年保留例外走匿名化）→ 加密交付 + 全程审计留痕，SLA 看板跟踪时限。 7.3 关键实现// 导出编排：并行拉取 + 交叉 PII 过滤 + 保留义务例外async function exportUserData(userId: string) &#123; const [orders, marketing, tickets] = await Promise.all([ adapters.orders.fetchAll(userId), // 订单系统 adapters.marketing.fetchAll(userId), // 营销系统（含行为埋点） adapters.tickets.fetchAll(userId), // 客服工单 ]); // 导出包不能带出他人数据（如客服粘贴的第三方手机号） const cleaned = redactThirdPartyPii([orders, marketing, tickets].flat()); // Article 17 例外：财务数据有 10 年保留义务，匿名化而非删除 const retention = await checkRetentionObligations(userId); const pkg = &#123; format: &#x27;json&#x27;, generatedAt: new Date(), data: cleaned, retained: retention.map(anonymize) &#125;; await audit.log(&#x27;gdpr_export&#x27;, &#123; userId, scope: pkg.scope &#125;); // 全程留痕 return uploadEncrypted(pkg, &#123; expiresDays: 7 &#125;); // 加密包 + 7 天时效链接&#125;
# 合规 SLA：30 天时限工单化，临近逾期自动升级 DPOsla: data_export: &#123; deadline_days: 30, warn_at: 21, escalate_to: dpo@corp.com &#125; data_erasure: &#123; deadline_days: 30, warn_at: 21, escalate_to: dpo@corp.com &#125;
7.4 踩坑点 日志系统的 PII 一开始没纳入导出范围，复检发现 nginx 日志含完整 IP+UA，补进数据目录 直接物理删除撞上财务保留义务，改为匿名化例外清单并经法务确认 导出包混入客服粘贴的他人手机号，属二次泄露，增加导出前交叉 PII 扫描 导出文件放公共对象存储桶，靠 URL 不可猜才没出事，改为时效签名链接 + 7 天过期
8. 常见误用与陷阱
坑 现象&#x2F;后果 解法
日志&#x2F;备份未入数据目录 导出与删除有死角，审计不通过 数据分类覆盖全部存储介质
无视保留义务直接删 违反财务&#x2F;税务法规 例外清单 + 匿名化替代删除
导出包含他人 PII 二次泄露，处罚升级 导出前交叉 PII 过滤
明文交付导出包 链接被转发即泄露 加密 + 时效签名 URL
30 天时限纯人工盯 逾期面临罚金 SLA 工单化 + 逾期自动升级
删除不覆盖派生数据 数仓&#x2F;推荐缓存仍有残留 删除事件广播到所有下游
9. 速查卡片GDPR 数据主体请求 SLAD+1 验证身份，登记请求留痕D+7 数据目录圈定系统与字段D+14 导出完成，交叉 PII 复检D+21 删除/匿名化（保留义务除外）D+28 加密包交付，时效链接D+30 法定时限，逾期升级 DPO
